<p>You chant the glory of the Sun, granting you <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">34, 46, 55, 63, 70</acronym> Mental Save and increasing your maximum life by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11%, 15%, 18%, 20%, 22%</acronym> (Currently:  <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">111, 150, 179, 203, 223</acronym>).</p><p>You may only have one Chant active at once.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Spellpower.</p>